# Line endings are normalised to LF inside the repository, so that an expression
# rebuilt by build_expression.py matches the committed one on any platform. Without
# this, a contributor on Linux or macOS regenerating the build sees every line of a
# 500-line file as changed -- which would make "it reproduces byte for byte" a claim
# that only held on the machine it was built on.
#
# Scoped to this resource deliberately: it does not disturb anything already committed
# elsewhere in the repository.
* text=auto
